OL,3,GNEWSAGP who restarted Fabrice Muamba's
OL,4,Aheart struck off
OL,5,
OL,6,FBetween July and November 2024, the GP
OL,7,Ffrom Preston in Lancashire obtained her
OL,8,Fphone number without consent, engaged
OL,9,Fin sexual activity with her while
OL,10,Fworking at Kirkham Health Centre and
OL,11,Fbooked appointments with her for no
OL,12,Fclinical reason.
OL,14,FIn 2012, Tobin helped to restart
OL,15,FFabrice Muamba's heart after the Bolton
OL,16,FWanderers midfielder collapsed on the
OL,17,Fpitch during an FA Cup tie against
OL,18,FTottenham.
